ster duly certified.","notes":null},{"title":"Business Plan","tag":"Business Plan","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-08-27","description":"A disaster recovery plan was submitted instead of a business plan. This still lacks certain information and criteria listed in the guidelines on the application portal. Outside of a disaster recovery situation, it does not include a management structure, nor does it detail the business risk rationale, allocated responsibilities, controls, provision of information about payment gateways, contractual and financial model with key suppliers. Nor does it include a 3 year financial forecast. Kindly review the guidelines on the portal, revise the business plan and resubmit.","notes":"20 Aug 2025: Dear RCL, Please review the updated business plan provided by the applicant and update the item. Customer Reply: Apologies. This must have been a technical mistake. We have now uploaded the Business plan with all necessary requirements."},{"title":"Source of funds of business","tag":"Source of Funds","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-08-27","description":"Kindly submit enhanced documentation as to how the business and its operations are being funded and by whom, as well as any documents evidencing any funding by shareholders or third parties. Kindly note that documents must be duly certified.","notes":"21 Aug 2025: Dear RCL, Could you please check why the SOF documents toggle has been marked as \"Approved\" while we are still missing a valid document that provides full insight into the company’s funding and additional required information? Kindly take action to clarify this, as it appears that the submitted SOF/SOW documents remain insufficient and also some outdated. Customer Reply: Two Source of Funds declarations were submitted on 27/03/2024 signed by the UBO and both have been approved. Do we need to do anything else about his please? RCL: According to the praxi at the time of vetting, SOF declarations were not invalid documents and could not be toggled negatively. This does not mean however that they were in any manner sufficient just because they were approved. Otherwise the CL would not have been opened for enhanced SOF documents. Whilst specific SOF docs have not yet been uploaded, note that 2 FS for year 2023 and 2024 indicating that the applicant is profitable through revenue and a updated business plan have been uploaded. This CL is being closed"},{"title":"Sonmez Hatice Aydogan","tag":"Share Ledger","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-08-27","description":"According to the MBR share capital Ms. Sonmez Hatice Aydogan owns half the company. Please advise why she was removed from the application.","notes":"20 Aug 2025: Dear RCL, Please revise this and update the status of this item. Customer Reply: She was not removed. She is the UBO and 50% shareholder. She was by mistake also listed as managing director which she is not."},{"title":"Compliance Officer","tag":"Operations","criticality":"Critical","due":"2024-07-31","description":"No compliance Officer submitted. Ensure compliance officer is fluent in AML matters.","notes":null},{"title":"Share Ledger","tag":"Share Ledger","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-08-26","description":"Submit an update certified share ledger","notes":"19 Aug 2025: Dear RCL, Please review the document uploaded. Customer Reply: Dully uploaded"},{"title":"QPA/2024/00353 - Sonmez Aydogan - SOW","tag":"Source of Wealth","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-27","description":"Please provide a certified bank statement with your name and the amount displayed.","notes":null}]}]},{"license":"CGA/2026/419/1376","status":"New","submitted":"N/A","endDate":"N/A","customer":{"contact":"Denitza Dimitrova","email":"denitza@ddconsultus.com","company":"TC Entertainment NV"},"timeline":[],"checklists":[]}]}